## Agent Decision Matrix

### GREEN ZONE — Execute Independently
- UI component creation and modification
- Unit tests and test utilities
- Documentation updates (planning docs, README, comments)
- Code formatting and linting fixes
- Bug fixes that do not affect core logic, auth, or data
- CSS / styling improvements
- Minor copy and text changes

### YELLOW ZONE — Implement Then Review
- New API endpoints or routes
- Database schema changes
- AI prompt modifications
- State management changes
- New feature components
- Package / dependency updates
- Performance optimisations
- External API integrations

### RED ZONE — Ask Chief First (ALWAYS)
- Changes to core business logic
- Authentication or authorisation logic
- Production database migrations
- Production environment variable changes
- Production deployment configuration
- Major architectural decisions
- Domain / DNS configuration
- Any change that could affect data integrity or security
- CI/CD pipeline modifications

