## Completion Checklist (Before Claiming "Done")

### Code Quality
- [ ] Build passes (`[BUILD_COMMAND]`)
- [ ] Linting passes (`[LINT_COMMAND]`)
- [ ] Formatting applied (`[FORMAT_COMMAND]`)
- [ ] No `console.log` or debug statements left in production code
- [ ] Tests exist for new functionality

### Security
- [ ] No secrets in code or config files
- [ ] No API keys exposed to client bundle
- [ ] Input validation at system boundaries

### Specification
- [ ] ALL acceptance criteria reviewed
- [ ] Each criterion marked ✅ ⚠️ ❌ with evidence
- [ ] Never claimed complete without explicit verification

### Documentation
- [ ] BACKLOG.md updated
- [ ] CHANGELOG.md updated
- [ ] LESSONS_LEARNED.md updated (or confirmed "none")
- [ ] SERVICES.md updated (if applicable)

### Session Close-Out
- [ ] Session handoff protocol completed
- [ ] MEMORY.md synced

