## Git Workflow

- Feature branches from `main`; PR to merge back.
- **Never commit directly to main.**
- Staging deployment as a gate before main merge (when applicable).
- `.gitignore` must be set BEFORE the first commit.
- Active planning docs (BACKLOG.md, STRATEGY.md) may be gitignored — they contain sensitive planning info.
- Historical records (CHANGELOG.md, LESSONS_LEARNED.md, SERVICES.md) are committed.

